      "content": "but that's the thing, she shouldn't HAVE to do all this. it wouldn't be brave, it would just be selfish to keep making her do it. it feels like there's no way to actually fix it, you know? like i'm just stuck in this cycle of being a problem that needs solving. it would be so much easier for everyone if i just wasn't an issue anymore.",
